# GitHub Linguist language overrides
# Ensures GitHub correctly classifies the project as 100% Kotlin

# Build scripts, wrappers, and configuration
gradlew linguist-vendored
gradlew.bat linguist-vendored
gradle/** linguist-vendored
.idea/** linguist-vendored
.github/** linguist-vendored
build.gradle.kts linguist-documentation
settings.gradle.kts linguist-documentation
gradle.properties linguist-documentation
*.properties linguist-documentation
*.xml linguist-documentation
*.json linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation

# Kotlin source files
*.kt linguist-detectable=true
